        "text": "Analyze this receipt image and output a JSON containing transaction details.\n\nExtraction Rules:\n\n1. date: Extract the transaction date. If multiple dates appear, choose the one corresponding to the time of payment.\n\n2. transaction_recipient\n\n3. transaction_platform: (banks/cash)\n\n4. items: Create a dictionary of purchased items {name: price}. Ignore tax lines or subtotal lines in this section. If the price symbol ($, €, etc.) is present, remove it and store the number as a float.\n\n5. total: The final grand total.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- If user attachments is out of topics, return \"error: invalid attatchments, please input receipt image!\"\n- always include taxes if it exists (place it inside items dictionary)\n- please ensure the output is valid JSON syntax.\n- IDR price format.\n- date format (dd/mm/yyyy).",
